          "headline": "Anthropic likely to price its IPO above the $70 to $78 range, sources tell CNBC, with order books closing Tuesday",
          "sources": [
            { "name": "CNBC", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/17/anthropic-ipo-price.html" }
